{"id":"ear-puni","name":{"en":"Ear Puni","ja":"耳ぷに"},"desc":{"en":"A Puni that grew rabbit ears for some reason. Nobody knows how growing ears turned it into something so powerful. Its grin will haunt your dreams.","ja":"耳が生えたぷにぷに。耳が生えただけでここまで強くなるのかと驚くくらいパワーアップしている。ぷにぷにだからと油断していると結構痛い目に遭いかねない。"},"race":"Puni","hp":70,"atk":26,"defen":8,"spd":8,"level":12,"locations":[{"id":"alanya-west-ruins","name":{"en":"Alanya West Ruins","ja":"アランヤ西部遺跡地帯"}},{"id":"arland-area","name":{"en":"Arland Area","ja":"アーランド周辺地域"}},{"id":"southwest-peninsula","name":{"en":"Southwest Peninsula","ja":"大陸南西半島"}},{"id":"northern-ruins","name":{"en":"Northern Ruins","ja":"北方遺跡"}},{"id":"stein-hill","name":{"en":"Stein Hill","ja":"シュタイン丘陵"},"parent":"alanya-west-ruins"},{"id":"ancient-monastery","name":{"en":"Ancient Monastery","ja":"古の修道院"},"parent":"northern-ruins"}],"item_set":[{"id":"puniball","name":{"en":"Puniball","ja":"ぷにぷに玉"}}],"isDX":false,"index":2}